  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuation of Voluntary Return and Reintegration Assistance in Latvia, 2019-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project represents the 8th phase of the national assisted voluntary return and reintegration programme (AVRR) for Latvia, implemented within the framework of the EU Return Directive 2008/115/EC. The project further builds on AVRR and best practices learned and seeks to assist migrants in their voluntary return and to provide reintegration assistance to migrants in situations of vulnerability.</narrative>
  </description>
